          ],
          "correctIndex": 1,
          "explanation": "Acceleration in rolling down an incline is a = g sin(θ) / (1 + I / (mR²)). For a solid sphere I = 2/5 mR², while for a hollow sphere I = 2/3 mR². Thus solid sphere has higher acceleration and reaches first."
